"before retrying; some changes may have been saved."
msgstr ""
"Shortlinks ko le pari iṣẹ yii. Ṣayẹwo ipin lọwọlọwọ ṣaaju ki o to tun "
"gbiyanju; diẹ ninu awọn ayipada le ti wa ni fipamọ."

#: includes/Mcp/Registry.php:220
msgid "This object changed. Read it again before saving."
msgstr "Nkan yii ti yipada. Ka lẹẹkansi ṣaaju ki o to fipamọ."

#: includes/Mcp/Registry.php:225
msgid ""
"The operation could not be fully confirmed. Read the object before "
"retrying; some changes may have been saved."
msgstr ""
"Iṣẹ naa ko le jẹrisi ni kikun. Ka nkan naa ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju; diẹ "
"ninu awọn ayipada le ti wa ni fipamọ."

